        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "value": "<p data-block-key=\"3riq2\">Here we have the centre of academic life: The Chancellor Paterson Library. The library houses a collection of over half a million books, more than forty-four thousand print and an extensive Archives and Special Collections.</p><p data-block-key=\"e2oji\">Visit the Learning Commons on the fifth floor, which fosters collaborative and social learning or a find quiet area in one of the many study spaces.</p>",
