          "type": "paragraph",
          "value": "<p data-block-key=\"3riq2\">The main floor features space for collaborative and social learning. Offering numerous tables and quiet study spaces, the library is perfect for individual focus or group projects. Comfortable, accessible, and well-equipped to support your learning needs.</p>",
